/* Loads themes that carry a palette, and themes in an 8-bit format, at every
   length short of the resource and with each byte replaced in turn, and decodes
   a JPEG whose frame header declares more components than the decoder holds.
   These are the resources that reach the palette bounds, the glyph data block
   bound, the page and pixelmap header re-reads of the load pass and the
   pixelmap index bound; the themes the other binary resource tests sweep carry
   no palette. */

